            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(24) The Office of Personnel Services will receive and review the recommended grants from the bank. If the grants from the bank are consistent with MCPS leave policies, the Office of Personnel Services will approve these bank grants to be paid by MCPS and forward same to the Division of Payroll. In all cases where the decisions of the Office of Personnel Services do not concur with the approval committee, the Office of Personnel Services shall explain in full the reasons for such a difference of opinion.",
