        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(25) The bank can be used on the first scheduled duty day of the contributing unit member immediately following the six-month waiting period. The maximum number of duty days that can be granted in any one fiscal year will be the remaining number of duty days a unit member is scheduled to work. In no case will the granting of leave from the bank cause a unit member to receive more than his/her annual salary.",
            "block_bbox": [
