        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "B. Leave Without Pay, Personal Illness, or Family Illness—On the superintendent's recommendation, the Board of Education may grant a leave of absence without pay to a unit member when that unit member or a member of his/her immediate family is ill. The leave shall be for definite periods, such as a semester or school year, and shall not exceed one (1) year. Applications for leave must be submitted in writing to the appropriate official and forwarded with his/her recommendation.",
